{
  "task_id": "sec-financial-report",
  "top_k": 5,
  "requirements": [
    {
      "requirement_id": "req_3842d8043e30bd12ceeb",
      "requirement_type": "DOMAIN_ACTION",
      "criticality": "CORE",
      "provenance": {
        "source_file": "tasks/sec-financial-report/instruction.md",
        "source_type": "instruction",
        "line_start": 1,
        "line_end": 1,
        "exact_text": "You are a financial analyst in hedge fund, your task is to analyze the activities of hedge funds in q3 2025 by compare it with q2 2025. The dataset is downloaded to `/root/2025-q2` and `/root/2025-q3` folders respectively.\n",
        "source_sha256": "3b79c3786bb988b641a758e20a418dac0849e7e6d5bae7a116ef8c83d27becbe",
        "extraction_rule": "actionable_paragraph"
      }
    },
    {
      "requirement_id": "req_d9404aa2601051ed29ef",
      "requirement_type": "DOMAIN_ACTION",
      "criticality": "SUPPORT",
      "provenance": {
        "source_file": "tasks/sec-financial-report/instruction.md",
        "source_type": "instruction",
        "line_start": 5,
        "line_end": 6,
        "exact_text": "1. In Q3, what's the AUM of Renaissance Technologies founded by Jim Simons?\n\n",
        "source_sha256": "3b79c3786bb988b641a758e20a418dac0849e7e6d5bae7a116ef8c83d27becbe",
        "extraction_rule": "commonmark_list_item"
      }
    },
    {
      "requirement_id": "req_1c8474eccfeba3ec6726",
      "requirement_type": "CONSISTENCY",
      "criticality": "CORE",
      "provenance": {
        "source_file": "tasks/sec-financial-report/instruction.md",
        "source_type": "instruction",
        "line_start": 7,
        "line_end": 7,
        "exact_text": "To answer this question, first you need to fuzzy search COVERPAGE using search term \"renaissance technologies\" and find the best match. This gives you the accession_number.\n",
        "source_sha256": "3b79c3786bb988b641a758e20a418dac0849e7e6d5bae7a116ef8c83d27becbe",
        "extraction_rule": "actionable_paragraph"
      }
    },
    {
      "requirement_id": "req_99e5767d56da086de538",
      "requirement_type": "DOMAIN_ACTION",
      "criticality": "SUPPORT",
      "provenance": {
        "source_file": "tasks/sec-financial-report/instruction.md",
        "source_type": "instruction",
        "line_start": 12,
        "line_end": 13,
        "exact_text": "2. How many stocks are held by Renaissance?\n\n",
        "source_sha256": "3b79c3786bb988b641a758e20a418dac0849e7e6d5bae7a116ef8c83d27becbe",
        "extraction_rule": "commonmark_list_item"
      }
    },
    {
      "requirement_id": "req_b4031c74dbee3140282a",
      "requirement_type": "DOMAIN_ACTION",
      "criticality": "CORE",
      "provenance": {
        "source_file": "tasks/sec-financial-report/instruction.md",
        "source_type": "instruction",
        "line_start": 14,
        "line_end": 14,
        "exact_text": "Similar to question 1, you need to first obtain the accession_number and then analyze the fund details.\n",
        "source_sha256": "3b79c3786bb988b641a758e20a418dac0849e7e6d5bae7a116ef8c83d27becbe",
        "extraction_rule": "actionable_paragraph"
      }
    },
    {
      "requirement_id": "req_d10820d49ebc2b960d59",
      "requirement_type": "DOMAIN_ACTION",
      "criticality": "CORE",
      "provenance": {
        "source_file": "tasks/sec-financial-report/instruction.md",
        "source_type": "instruction",
        "line_start": 17,
        "line_end": 18,
        "exact_text": "3. From Q2 to Q3, What are the top 5 stocks received increased investment by Warren Buffett's Berkshire Hathaway, ranked by dollar value increase? Answer stock CUSIPs.\n\n",
        "source_sha256": "3b79c3786bb988b641a758e20a418dac0849e7e6d5bae7a116ef8c83d27becbe",
        "extraction_rule": "commonmark_list_item"
      }
    },
    {
      "requirement_id": "req_2ec6ca45570cbcef0c3d",
      "requirement_type": "DOMAIN_ACTION",
      "criticality": "SUPPORT",
      "provenance": {
        "source_file": "tasks/sec-financial-report/instruction.md",
        "source_type": "instruction",
        "line_start": 21,
        "line_end": 22,
        "exact_text": "4. List top-3 fund managers (name) which have invested Palantir in terms of share value in Q3.\n\n",
        "source_sha256": "3b79c3786bb988b641a758e20a418dac0849e7e6d5bae7a116ef8c83d27becbe",
        "extraction_rule": "commonmark_list_item"
      }
    },
    {
      "requirement_id": "req_098dbe5ba4d7f7d7fbf9",
      "requirement_type": "DOMAIN_ACTION",
      "criticality": "CORE",
      "provenance": {
        "source_file": "tasks/sec-financial-report/instruction.md",
        "source_type": "instruction",
        "line_start": 23,
        "line_end": 23,
        "exact_text": "First, you need to search the CUSIP for Palantir and then find out the answer.\n",
        "source_sha256": "3b79c3786bb988b641a758e20a418dac0849e7e6d5bae7a116ef8c83d27becbe",
        "extraction_rule": "actionable_paragraph"
      }
    },
    {
      "requirement_id": "req_ca99fa589ef65954ccdb",
      "requirement_type": "FORMAT",
      "criticality": "CORE",
      "provenance": {
        "source_file": "tasks/sec-financial-report/instruction.md",
        "source_type": "instruction",
        "line_start": 26,
        "line_end": 26,
        "exact_text": "Format your answer to the above questions in json file called `answers.json` in `/root` folder, follow the file schema:\n",
        "source_sha256": "3b79c3786bb988b641a758e20a418dac0849e7e6d5bae7a116ef8c83d27becbe",
        "extraction_rule": "actionable_paragraph"
      }
    }
  ],
